# Contributor Covenant Code of Conduct

## Our Pledge
We pledge to make participation in our project a welcoming and respectful experience for everyone.

## Our Standards
- Be respectful and considerate.
- Accept constructive feedback.
- Focus on what is best for the community.
- Avoid harassment, discrimination, and personal attacks.

## Enforcement Responsibilities
Project maintainers are responsible for clarifying and enforcing these standards.

## Scope
This Code of Conduct applies to all project spaces and public interactions related to the project.

## Enforcement
Unacceptable behavior may be addressed by project maintainers, including warnings or removal from the project.

## Enforcement Guidelines
Maintainers will respond fairly and proportionately to reported incidents.

## Attribution
This Code of Conduct is inspired by the Contributor Covenant.
